# Browser-automation artifacts from local verification runs.
# Deliberately not "*.png": this is a docs tool, and real image assets
# belong in the repo. Stray screenshots should stay visible in git status.
.playwright-mcp/

# A root `go build` drops the binary here, next to the package it built.
# Anchored: cmd/md2html is a directory that must stay tracked.
/md2html

# Rendered docs
docs/**/*.html
